---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = "중국 여행 짐 준비 — 계절별 기후 가이드";
const description = "계절과 도시에 따라 달라지는 중국 여행 짐 리스트입니다.";
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} lang="ko">
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <nav class="mb-8 not-prose">
      <a href="/ko/life/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-700 transition no-underline group">
        <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 transition-transform group-hover:-translate-x-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/>
        </svg>
        ← 생활 가이드로 돌아가기
      </a>
    </nav>
    <header class="mb-12">
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-3">🎒 중국 생활</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-4 leading-tight">중국 여행 짐 준비: 계절별 기후 가이드</h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-6">중국 기후는 어디를 가느냐에 따라 완전히 달라집니다. 진짜 필요한 것만 알려드립니다.</p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-500">
        <span>📅 최종 업데이트: 2026년 6월</span>
        <span>⏱️ 읽는 시간: 6분</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-green-50 to-emerald-50 border-l-4 border-green-500 rounded-r-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-green-900 mb-4">🎯 빠른 답변</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-green-800 leading-relaxed"><strong>중국은 계절별 기후 차이가 큽니다.</strong> 베이징 겨울 영하 10°C, 광저우 여름 35°C 이상. 겹쳐 입기와 방문할 도시에 맞춘 준비가 핵심입니다. 공통 필수품: 편한 신발, 보조배터리, 휴지, 재사용 물병.</p>
    </div>

    <nav class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">📋 목차</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-3">
        <li><a href="#year-round" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🎒 연중 필수품</a></li>
        <li><a href="#spring" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🌸 봄 (3~5월)</a></li>
        <li><a href="#summer" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">☀️ 여름 (6~8월)</a></li>
        <li><a href="#autumn" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🍂 가을 (9~11월)</a></li>
        <li><a href="#winter" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">❄️ 겨울 (12~2월)</a></li>
        <li><a href="#city-guide" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🏙️ 도시별 퀵 가이드</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>

    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />
      <h2 id="year-round" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="text-4xl">🎒</span> 연중 필수품</h2>
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-8">언제 어디를 가든 이것들은 꼭 챙기세요:</p>

      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-6 not-prose">
        <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
          <caption class="text-sm text-gray-500 italic mb-2">중국 여행 계절별 패킹 가이드</caption>
          <thead><tr class="bg-gray-900 text-white"><th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">물품</th><th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">이유</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4"><strong>보조배터리</strong></td><td class="px-6 py-4">내비+번역+결제로 배터리 소모 빠름</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4"><strong>만능 어댑터</strong></td><td class="px-6 py-4">중국 A/I형 플러그 (220V)</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4"><strong>휴대용 휴지</strong></td><td class="px-6 py-4">공중화장실 휴지 없는 경우 많음</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4"><strong>손 소독제</strong></td><td class="px-6 py-4">비누 없는 곳도 있음</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4"><strong>재사용 물병</strong></td><td class="px-6 py-4">호텔·역에 온수 제공</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4"><strong>편한 운동화</strong></td><td class="px-6 py-4">하루 15,000보 이상</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4"><strong>작은 백팩</strong></td><td class="px-6 py-4">큰 가방 반입 금지 관광지 있음</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4"><strong>여권·비자 사본</strong></td><td class="px-6 py-4">디지털 사본도 보관</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-yellow-50 border border-yellow-100 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-12 not-prose">
        <p class="text-gray-700"><strong>중요:</strong> 국내선·고속철도 보안검색 시 보조배터리는 3C 인증과 20,000mAh 이하만 허용됩니다. 여러 도시 방문 시 첫 도착 도시에서 구매하세요.</p>
      </div>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />
      <h2 id="spring" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="text-4xl">🌸</span> 봄 (3~5월)</h2>
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6"><strong>기온:</strong> 10°C~25°C (베이징 선선, 광저우 따뜻)</p>
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-8"><strong>특징:</strong> 온화하지만 변덕스러움. 4~5월 비 많음.</p>
      <p class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">준비물:</p>
      <ul class="space-y-3 mb-12">
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span> 얇은 자켓 (봄 저녁은 쌀쌀함)</li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span> 긴바지·긴팔 셔츠</li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span> 우산이나 얇은 비옷</li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span> 스카프 (바람·먼지 대비)</li>
      </ul>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />
      <h2 id="summer" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="text-4xl">☀️</span> 여름 (6~8월)</h2>
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6"><strong>기온:</strong> 25°C~40°C (베이징 건조, 광저우·상하이 습함)</p>
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-8"><strong>특징:</strong> 전국적으로 더움. 남부 도시 특히 습함. 장마철 있음.</p>
      <p class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">준비물:</p>
      <ul class="space-y-3 mb-12">
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span> 가볍고 통기성 좋은 옷</li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span> 선크림 (SPF 50+)</li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span> 선글라스·모자</li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span> 우산 (햇빛·비 모두 대비)</li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-red-500">⚠️</span> 자금성·만리장성은 그늘 부족, 대비 필수</li>
      </ul>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />
      <h2 id="autumn" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="text-4xl">🍂</span> 가을 (9~11월)</h2>
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6"><strong>기온:</strong> 5°C~22°C (선선하고 쾌적)</p>
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-8"><strong>특징:</strong> 가장 쾌적한 계절. 하늘 맑고 공기 좋음.</p>
      <p class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">준비물:</p>
      <ul class="space-y-3 mb-12">
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span> 티셔츠+얇은 자켓 레이어</li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span> 청바지나 편한 바지</li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span> 중간 두께 자켓 (저녁 대비)</li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span> 야외 활동에 최적의 계절</li>
      </ul>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />
      <h2 id="winter" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="text-4xl">❄️</span> 겨울 (12~2월)</h2>
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6"><strong>기온:</strong> -15°C (베이징) ~ 15°C (광저우)</p>
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-8"><strong>특징:</strong> 북부는 혹한, 남부는 온화. 건조.</p>
      <p class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">북부 갈 경우 준비물 (남부는 가을과 동일):</p>
      <ul class="space-y-3 mb-12">
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span> 두꺼운 패딩/코트 (베이징·시안 필수)</li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span> 내복 (북부 갈 경우)</li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span> 모자·장갑·목도리 (겨울엔 선택 아님)</li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-green-500">✅</span> 립밤·보습제 (난방으로 건조)</li>
        <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-red-500">⚠️</span> 하얼빈은 영하 30°C — 극한용 장비 필요</li>
      </ul>

      <hr class="border-gray-200 my-12" />
      <h2 id="city-guide" class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="text-4xl">🏙️</span> 도시별 퀵 가이드</h2>
      <div class="overflow-x-auto mb-12 not-prose">
        <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
          <caption class="text-sm text-gray-500 italic mb-2">중국 도시별 기후 비교</caption>
          <thead><tr class="bg-gray-900 text-white"><th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">도시</th><th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">여름 (°C)</th><th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">겨울 (°C)</th><th class="px-6 py-4 font-bold">패킹 팁</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">베이징</td><td>25–35</td><td>-10~5</td><td>겨울 두꺼운 코트, 여름 자외선 차단</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">상하이</td><td>25–37</td><td>0~10</td><td>연중 습함; 우비 필수</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">광저우</td><td>28–38</td><td>10~18</td><td>연중 따뜻; 얇은 옷+우비</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">선전</td><td>28–35</td><td>12~20</td><td>광저우와 비슷; 여름엔 수영복</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100"><td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">청두</td><td>22–32</td><td>2~10</td><td>흐린 날 많음; 레이어 필수</td></tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-gray-100 bg-gray-50"><td class="px-6 py-4 font-semibold">시안</td><td>23–35</td><td>-5~8</td><td>베이징과 비슷하나 약간 더 따뜻</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 not-prose">
      <div class="border-t border-gray-100 pt-6 mt-8">
        <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-50 to-blue-50 border border-brand-100 rounded-xl p-5 not-prose">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 flex-wrap">
            <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-gray-900">📚 함께 읽기</h3>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
              <a href="/ko/life/essential-apps/" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 px-4 py-2.5 bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl text-sm font-medium text-gray-900 hover:border-brand-300 hover:shadow-sm transition no-underline">📱 중국 필수 앱 10선<svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg></a>
              <a href="/ko/transport/transport-guide/" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 px-4 py-2.5 bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl text-sm font-medium text-gray-900 hover:border-brand-300 hover:shadow-sm transition no-underline">🚄 중국 교통 가이드<svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg></a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>